# Frameora

<p align="center">
  <strong>Frameora</strong><br>
  Android photo editor focused on EXIF metadata and customizable photographic overlays.
</p>

---

## 📸 About

Frameora is an Android application designed for photographers who want to enhance their photographs with useful photographic information without modifying the original file.

The project focuses on combining **photography metadata**, **visual customization** and **high-quality export** in a simple workflow.

The original photograph is always treated as the source. Edits are intended to generate a new file rather than overwrite the original.

---

## ✨ Current Features

- 📷 Import photographs from the device
- 🔍 Read EXIF metadata
- 🖼️ Display the selected photograph
- 🔄 Handle image orientation from EXIF
- 📊 Display camera information
- 🎛️ Select which metadata fields are displayed
- 📐 Display focal length
- 🔭 Display aperture
- ⚡ Display shutter speed
- 🎚️ Display ISO
- 📅 Display capture date and time
- 🔬 Display lens information
- 📏 Display 35 mm equivalent focal length
- 🔎 Display digital zoom
- 💡 Display flash information
- 📍 Display GPS coordinates
- 🎨 Preview metadata below the photograph
- 📱 Support portrait and landscape photographs

